00:24:16.329 --> 00:24:18.915
and they put it all in one place
so that you can

00:24:18.915 --> 00:24:20.625
then choose
what you want to take down

00:24:20.625 --> 00:24:23.545
with the help of Incognis
human removal specialists.

00:24:23.545 --> 00:24:24.838
To get your data off the market

00:24:24.838 --> 00:24:28.008
today, you can go to
Incogni.com/Veritasium and use

00:24:28.008 --> 00:24:31.136
the code Veritasium
to get 60% off their annual plan.

00:24:31.136 --> 00:24:34.014
You can also click the link in the
